;
; 1 rule: protected-header-map.
;
; Byte-for-byte identical in body to Figure 4 (lines 487-491) -- the same
; rule name with the same body, stated twice in the document. RFC 8610
; still forbids the redefinition, so the two cannot be concatenated.
; Also preserved: the undefined SINGULAR "cose-value" on line 602, and the
; reliance on "cose-label" which only Figure 1 defines.
; See README.md, "Defects".
;
